# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — Conan 2 conandata.yml patches 必须用 list 格式 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-17
# Software: shoco master (Ed-von-Schleck/shoco, C99 短字符串压缩库)
# Gate: conan-verify G2 迭代链（本地 W3 前验证）
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-shoco-master-conandata-patches-list
trigger_tool:           conan|conan create
phase:                  build
error_signature:        No patches defined for version master|
                         WARN: apply_conandata_patches.*No patches defined|
                         undefined symbol: alloca.*patches|patch.*not applied

severity:               2
category:               conan, packaging, patch, conandata
match_keywords:         conandata.yml, patches, dict, list, apply_conandata_patches, patch_file,
                         patch_description, patch_type, version key, silent no-op, master
title:                  Conan 2 apply_conandata_patches：conandata.yml patches 为 dict 时按 version 键查找，文件名键会静默不应用，必须用 list 格式

root_cause:             Conan 2 的 apply_conandata_patches 对 dict 类型 patches 按
                         `{version: [patch列表]}` 结构用 conanfile.version 做键查找；若误写成
                         `{补丁文件名: {...}}`（键是文件名而非版本），查找不到该版本即打印
                         "No patches defined for version <ver>" 并静默返回，补丁完全不应用。
                         list 类型 `[{patch_file: ...}]` 才是无条件全量应用。静默不应用导致
                         后续编译/链接报底层错误（如 alloca 缺声明），极难定位。
affected_scope:         所有 Conan 2 配方在 conandata.yml 用 dict 形式声明补丁的场景；尤其
                         version 为 "master"/滚动分支（键查找必然失配）。
verification_cmd:       conan create ... 2>&1 | grep -E "Apply patch|No patches defined"

# 真实证据: shoco master (2026-09-17) conan-verify G2 失败后修复
# 修复: conandata.yml patches 由 dict 改 list（patch_file/patch_description/patch_type）后补丁生效，G2 PASS

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           conandata-patches-list-format
rec_description:        conandata.yml 的 patches 一律用 list 格式：
                         patches:
                           - patch_file: "patches/0001-xxx.patch"
                             patch_description: "..."
                             patch_type: "portability"
                         避免 dict（{version: [...]}）语义带来的键查找陷阱。
rec_command:            "把 conandata.yml 中 'patches: {key: {patch_file: ...}}' 改写为 'patches:\n  - patch_file: ...'"
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conandata-edit

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      direct-patch-call
fallback_description:   若必须保留新版本文档结构，可在 build() 中改用 conan.tools.files.patch 直接调用，
                         不受 conandata patches 结构影响。
fallback_command:       "patch(self, patch_file=os.path.join(self.export_sources_folder, 'patches/xxx.patch'))"
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          conanfile-edit

forbid_1_pattern:       patches:\n\s+"[a-z0-9-]+\.patch":\s*\n\s+patch_file:
forbid_1_reason:        dict 键为文件名时，apply_conandata_patches 按 version 键查找必然失配（除非文件名恰为版本号）。
forbid_1_consequence:   补丁静默不应用，后续编译/链接报底层错误，W3 前难定位。

doc_file: doc/E-shoco-master-conandata-patches-list.md
source_pr: (pending — shoco master feat/shoco-master)
last_updated:           2026-09-17
authors: pc1-47 <noreply@atomgit.com>